1	# Home's AI card and first-run page showed an old account (fix on claude/home-account-refresh)
2	
3	Branch `claude/home-account-refresh`, commit 4da941e553, worktree
4	/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/home-account-refresh (Release build in build/arm64).
5	Not pushed; waits on Kenneth.
6	
7	## Causes
8	- OrcaHomeBackend fetched /ent/jusprin/v2/account once per app run (m_account_requested never reset),
9	  so the credits never changed and a later account inherited the earlier one's balance.
10	- ShellController::open_preferences never re-sent Home's state after the window closed, so a
11	  sign-out or sign-in in Preferences did not reach Home or the first-run import page until
12	  something else redrew Home.
13	
14	## Fix
15	Credits are kept with the email they belong to (dropped and re-read when it changes), re-read each
16	time Home comes on screen, and re-read with a Home redraw when Preferences closes.
17	
18	## Evidence
19	- Staging, real app, before the fix: k+stg-e2e1 showed "494 credits left" on Home; after one
20	  Standard request the server said 493; Home still said 494 after New project and back.
21	  Screenshot: scratchpad/evidence/credits-before-fix-home-494-server-493.jpg (session f7445e00).
22	- Shell harness --fresh-example (stand-in server): new checks fail without the fix (card still
23	  "Signed in as alex@example.com / 500 credits left" after the server dropped to 493 and after the
24	  real Preferences Sign out button was clicked) and pass with it. Default harness mode: 625 checks,
25	  0 failures. jusprin_tests: all 175 cases pass.
26	
27	## Not done
28	- The fixed build was not checked in the real app against staging: screen access to the fixed copy
29	  was refused / timed out, and clicks inside the modal Preferences window need full-screen control.
30	  Ready to run: scratchpad/Fixed.app with --datadir scratchpad/data3 (signed in to staging as
31	  k+stg-e2e1; that staging token expires 2026-11-11).
32	- clang-tidy could not be run: this Mac's Python has no SSL, so the pinned clang-tidy can't install.
33	  `#include <string>` was added by hand for the changed lines.
34	- After a sign-out, Home shows no AI group at all (home_agent_card returns None while
35	  jusprin_agent.enabled stays true). That predates this change.
